    "title": "Concept: What is Mitosis?",
    "explanation": "<p class=\"text-sm leading-6 text-muted-foreground\">Mitosis is a process of <strong>cell division</strong> where one parent cell divides to produce two genetically <em>identical daughter cells</em>. This process is essential for <strong>growth, repair</strong> of tissues, and <strong>asexual reproduction</strong> in some organisms.</p>",
